{"a4896718-ecef-4701-8497-5ba07d4e89cc":{"id":"a4896718-ecef-4701-8497-5ba07d4e89cc","title":"Academy Player reul Jugyeotda","altTitle":"I Killed the Main Player","description":"Being a character of your favorite game is great! Sure, he’s just a minor NPC, but Corin knows this game like the back of his hand. With his knowledge and the main player Sihu’s abilities, everything’s going smoothly - until Corin discovers Sihu’s been murdering innocent NPCs and stealing their items. \n\nHorrified but powerless to stop him, Corin awaits the end of the game - only for Sihu to mysteriously fail at the last mission. \n\nInstantly, Corin travels three years back in time. Now, he’s determined to kill Sihu and take on his role - defeat the final boss and save the world.","year":2023,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Romance","Adventure","Isekai","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/a4896718-ecef-4701-8497-5ba07d4e89cc/63745a40-72b0-4d8a-b186-9c2d2a081879.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["pt-br","es-la","ru","en","pl"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.9,"follows":13481,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:35:48.689Z","chapters":[{"id":"4cb5ffe7-2019-4830-bc4b-dadc161444aa","number":"76","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":26,"createdAt":"2025-07-01T23:26:53+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"b5101e7d-82b2-4ccf-881d-709e683e2c88","number":"73","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":22,"createdAt":"2025-06-26T23:36:14+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"bf8004bf-b57d-4c2e-b0c4-a5db100a6f2e","number":"71","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2025-06-24T19:53:12+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"40999189-a150-4b3e-856b-3aa2bca9a03d","number":"69.5","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":1,"createdAt":"2025-06-17T23:19:03+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":4,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:28:52.250Z"},"e1dab458-caeb-49c3-acb5-78f06fe392b7":{"id":"e1dab458-caeb-49c3-acb5-78f06fe392b7","title":"Akujo Kyosei Keikaku","altTitle":"The Villainess Correction Plan","description":"\"Hey, Seraphina. Even when you grow up, don't end up killing me, okay?\"\n\nThe wizard Arvel meets his end at the hands of his former fiancée, Seraphina, who later became the emperor's mistress and a notorious villainess. However, when he comes to, he finds himself face-to-face with a young Seraphina! Astonishingly, he has returned to being his 13-year-old self. Seeing Seraphina before she became a villainess, Arvel makes a resolution: he will raise her to become a proper person and save his own life.\n\nTo start, he begins searching for a way to prevent the death of his brother, Sho, who was once engaged to Seraphina. However, the situation is far from simple, as he must contend with Seraphina's neglectful family, men vying for the beautiful Seraphina's attention, and a web of conflicting intentions. In this journey through time, can Arvel alter Seraphina's fate and save her from becoming a villainess...!?","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Romance","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/e1dab458-caeb-49c3-acb5-78f06fe392b7/183921d1-e064-4b6b-b59f-d825c5316ce2.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","vi"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.55,"follows":8779,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:35:16.630Z","chapters":[{"id":"febd4cd8-d438-4681-9e41-5e8312fd433d","number":"18.2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":17,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T22:20:09+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"a1fbead5-84ce-400b-935b-91fb23892a67","number":"18.1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":17,"createdAt":"2026-10-04T08:21:22+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d4ec4bf1-8280-4b72-ab36-8445fd65385c","number":"17.2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":15,"createdAt":"2026-08-17T18:15:12+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6b6e4e4a-bd04-4ca4-bf4b-434284c55f8f","number":